#: include/global_settings.php:2821
msgid "DS Filter"
msgstr "DS-filter"

#: include/global_settings.php:2822
msgid "Specifies the DSes inside an RRD upon which Spikekill will operate. A string of comma-separated values that contains index numbers or names of desired DSes. If left blank, all DSes will match. An example is <i>\"5,traffic_*\"</i>, which would match DS index 5 as well as any DS whose name begins with <i>\"traffic_\"</i>. "
msgstr ""
"Anger vilka datakällor (DS) i en RRD-fil som Spikekill ska behandla. Ange en "
"kommaseparerad lista med indexnummer eller namn. Om fältet lämnas tomt "
"matchas alla datakällor. Till exempel matchar <i>\"5,traffic_*\"</i> "
"datakällan med index 5 och alla datakällor vars namn börjar med <i>"
"\"traffic_\"</i>. "

#: include/global_settings.php:2829
msgid "RRDfile Backup Directory"
msgstr "Säkerhetskopieringskatalog för RRD-filer"

#: include/global_settings.php:2830
msgid "If this directory is not empty, then your original RRDfiles will be backed up to this location."
msgstr "Ange katalogen där de ursprungliga RRD-filerna ska säkerhetskopieras."

#: include/global_settings.php:2837
msgid "Batch Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Inställningar för satsvis borttagning av toppar"

#: include/global_settings.php:2842
msgid "Removal Schedule"
msgstr "Schema för borttagning"

#: include/global_settings.php:2843
msgid "Do you wish to periodically remove spikes from your graphs?  If so, select the frequency below."
msgstr ""
"Vill du ta bort toppar från graferna regelbundet? Välj i så fall frekvensen "
"nedan."

#: include/global_settings.php:2850
msgid "Once a Day"
msgstr "En gång om dagen"

#: include/global_settings.php:2851
msgid "Every Other Day"
msgstr "Varannan dag"

#: include/global_settings.php:2855
msgid "Base Time"
msgstr "Bastid"

#: include/global_settings.php:2856
msgid "The Base Time for Spike removal to occur.  For example, if you use '12:00am' and you choose once per day, the batch removal would begin at approximately midnight every day."
msgstr ""
"Bastiden för borttagning av toppar. Om du till exempel anger ”12:00am” och "
"väljer en gång per dag börjar den satsvisa borttagningen omkring midnatt "
"varje dag."

#: include/global_settings.php:2863
msgid "Graph Templates to Spike Kill"
msgstr "Grafmallar för borttagning av toppar"

#: include/global_settings.php:2865
msgid "When performing batch spike removal, only the templates selected below will be acted on."
msgstr ""
"Vid satsvis borttagning av toppar används endast mallarna som valts nedan."

#: include/global_settings.php:2869
msgid "Backup Retention"
msgstr "Lagringstid för säkerhetskopior"

#: include/global_settings.php:2870
msgid "When SpikeKill kills spikes in graphs, it makes a backup of the RRDfile.  How long should these backup files be retained?"
msgstr ""
"När SpikeKill tar bort toppar i grafer säkerhetskopieras RRD-filen. Hur "
